mapping "W2618.1" source="W2618" target="242772009" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source W2618 (Swedish national extension of W26 SNOMED CT 242772009, place=institutional housing,
        activity=other specified) is a Swedish 6-digit subdivision encoding place+activity context for
        the base W26 injury mechanism. No WHO ICD-10 nor OMOP standard concept exists for the
        place/activity subdivision. Target SNOMED CT 4055051 = (concept_code 242772009), the Athena target
        for the parent ICD10 W26 (concept_id 45756279). Target fully subsumes every Swedish extension of
        W26 because the clinical injury mechanism is identical; only the contextual activity metadata
        differs. broader (one-level): target is the legitimate ancestor. High : verified Athena
        crosswalk on the parent, small well-understood breadth mismatch from the unspecified
        activity-level subdivision.
        """
}
